<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
 <meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
 <title>Wallet Addresses — ONBOARD3 Admin</title>
 <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
 <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="a-bg"></div>
<%- include('../partials/nav', { page:'wallet-addresses', admin:user }) %>

<div class="a-main">
 <div class="a-content" style="max-width:900px">
 <div class="a-page-header">
 <div>
 <h1><i class="fas fa-wallet"></i> Crypto Wallet Addresses</h1>
 <p>Manage deposit addresses shown to businesses for funding</p>
 </div>
 <button class="a-btn a-btn-primary" onclick="document.getElementById('addModal').style.display='flex'">
 <i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Add Address
 </button>
 </div>

 <% if (typeof query !== 'undefined' && query && query.success) { %>
 <div style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);border:1px solid rgba(16,185,129,.3);border-radius:8px;padding:.875rem 1rem;color:#6ee7b7;font-size:.875rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
 <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Wallet address added successfully.
 </div>
 <% } %>

 <!-- Network info -->
 <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
 <% [['solana','Solana (SPL)','#9945ff'],['bnb','BNB Chain (BEP-20)','#f0b90b'],['erc20','Ethereum (ERC-20)','#627eea']].forEach(function(n){ %>
 <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem 1.25rem">
 <div style="font-size:.875rem;font-weight:700;color:<%= n[2] %>;margin-bottom:.25rem"><%= n[1] %></div>
 <div style="font-size:.75rem;color:var(--text-3)">
 <% const count = wallets.filter(w => w.network === n[0]).length; %>
 <%= count %> address<%= count !== 1 ? 'es' : '' %> configured
 </div>
 </div>
 <% }) %>
 </div>

 <div class="a-card">
 <% if (!wallets.length) { %>
 <div style="text-align:center;padding:3rem;color:var(--text-3)">
 <i class="fas fa-wallet" style="font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:1rem;opacity:.4;display:block"></i>
 <p>No wallet addresses configured. Add addresses so businesses can fund their accounts.</p>
 </div>
 <% } else { %>
 <div class="a-table-wrap">
 <table class="at">
 <thead>
 <tr>
 <th>Token</th>
 <th>Network</th>
 <th>Label</th>
 <th>Address</th>
 <th>Status</th>
 <th>Added</th>
 <th>Actions</th>
 </tr>
 </thead>
 <tbody>
 <% wallets.forEach(w => { %>
 <tr>
 <td><span class="a-badge a-badge-info" style="font-size:.75rem"><%= w.token %></span></td>
 <td style="color:var(--text-2);font-size:.875rem">
 <% if(w.network==='solana'){ %><span style="color:#9945ff"><i class="fas fa-circle" style="font-size:.5rem"></i> Solana (SPL)</span>
 <% } else if(w.network==='bnb'){ %><span style="color:#f0b90b"><i class="fas fa-circle" style="font-size:.5rem"></i> BNB (BEP-20)</span>
 <% } else { %><span style="color:#627eea"><i class="fas fa-circle" style="font-size:.5rem"></i> ETH (ERC-20)</span><% } %>
 </td>
 <td style="color:var(--text-2);font-size:.875rem"><%= w.label || '—' %></td>
 <td>
 <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem">
 <span style="font-family:monospace;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-3);max-width:220px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap" title="<%= w.address %>"><%= w.address %></span>
 <button onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('<%= w.address %>').then(()=>{this.innerHTML='<i class=\\'fas fa-check\\'></i>';setTimeout(()=>{this.innerHTML='<i class=\\'fas fa-copy\\'></i>'},1000)})" style="background:none;border:none;color:var(--text-3);cursor:pointer;font-size:.75rem;padding:.2rem">
 <i class="fas fa-copy"></i>
 </button>
 </div>
 </td>
 <td>
 <span class="a-badge a-badge-<%= w.isActive ? 'success' : 'neutral' %>">
 <%= w.isActive ? 'Active' : 'Inactive' %>
 </span>
 </td>
 <td style="color:var(--text-3);font-size:.8rem"><%= new Date(w.createdAt).toLocaleDateString() %></td>
 <td>
 <div style="display:flex;gap:.375rem">
 <button class="a-btn a-btn-secondary" style="padding:.35rem .75rem;font-size:.75rem" onclick="toggleWallet('<%= w._id %>', this)">
 <i class="fas fa-<%= w.isActive ? 'pause' : 'play' %>"></i> <%= w.isActive ? 'Disable' : 'Enable' %>
 </button>
 <button class="a-btn a-btn-danger" style="padding:.35rem .75rem;font-size:.75rem" onclick="deleteWallet('<%= w._id %>')">
 <i class="fas fa-trash"></i>
 </button>
 </div>
 </td>
 </tr>
 <% }) %>
 </tbody>
 </table>
 </div>
 <% } %>
 </div>

 <div class="a-card" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
 <h3 style="font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:.875rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem">
 <i class="fas fa-info-circle" style="color:var(--amber)"></i> How it works
 </h3>
 <div style="color:var(--text-2);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.7">
 <p>When a business requests funding, they select a <strong>token</strong> (USDC or USDT) and a <strong>network</strong> (Solana, BNB, or ERC-20). The system looks up the active wallet address for that combination and displays it to the business.</p>
 <p style="margin-top:.625rem">The business sends crypto to that address and uploads a payment screenshot. You verify the screenshot in <strong>Fund Requests</strong> and approve it to credit their balance.</p>
 <p style="margin-top:.625rem">You can have multiple addresses per token/network (all active ones are shown by lookup), so deactivating one won't break existing flows.</p>
 </div>
 </div>
 </div>
</div>

<!-- Add Modal -->
<div id="addModal" style="display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.75);z-index:200;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
 <div style="background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;width:100%;max-width:500px;margin:1rem">
 <div style="padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
 <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:800"><i class="fas fa-plus" style="color:var(--green)"></i> Add Wallet Address</h3>
 <button onclick="document.getElementById('addModal').style.display='none'" style="background:none;border:none;color:var(--text-3);font-size:1.125rem;cursor:pointer"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
 </div>
 <form method="POST" action="/admin/wallet-addresses/add">
 <div style="padding:1.5rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem">
 <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem">
 <div>
 <label style="display:block;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:.375rem">Token *</label>
 <select name="token" required style="width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:.75rem 1rem;color:var(--text);font-size:.875rem;outline:none;font-family:inherit">
 <option value="USDC">USDC</option>
 <option value="USDT">USDT</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 <div>
 <label style="display:block;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:.375rem">Network *</label>
 <select name="network" required style="width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:.75rem 1rem;color:var(--text);font-size:.875rem;outline:none;font-family:inherit">
 <option value="solana">Solana (SPL)</option>
 <option value="bnb">BNB Chain (BEP-20)</option>
 <option value="erc20">Ethereum (ERC-20)</option>
 </select>
 </div>
 </div>
 <div>
 <label style="display:block;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:.375rem">Wallet Address *</label>
 <input type="text" name="address" required placeholder="Paste wallet address..." style="width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:.75rem 1rem;color:var(--text);font-size:.875rem;outline:none;font-family:monospace">
 </div>
 <div>
 <label style="display:block;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:.375rem">Label (shown to businesses)</label>
 <input type="text" name="label" placeholder="e.g. USDC · Solana Network" style="width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:.75rem 1rem;color:var(--text);font-size:.875rem;outline:none;font-family:inherit">
 </div>
 </div>
 <div style="padding:1rem 1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;gap:.5rem;justify-content:flex-end">
 <button type="button" onclick="document.getElementById('addModal').style.display='none'" class="a-btn a-btn-secondary" style="padding:.5rem 1rem;font-size:.8125rem">Cancel</button>
 <button type="submit" class="a-btn a-btn-primary" style="padding:.5rem 1rem;font-size:.8125rem"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save Address</button>
 </div>
 </form>
 </div>
</div>

<script>
function toggleWallet(id, btn) {
 fetch('/admin/wallet-addresses/' + id + '/toggle', { method: 'POST' })
 .then(r => r.json()).then(d => { if (d.success) location.reload(); });
}
function deleteWallet(id) {
 if (!confirm('Remove this wallet address? Businesses will no longer see it.')) return;
 fetch('/admin/wallet-addresses/' + id + '/delete', { method: 'POST' })
 .then(r => r.json()).then(d => { if (d.success) location.reload(); else alert(d.message); });
}
</script>
<%- include('../../partials/whatsapp-float') %>
</body>
</html>
